{"id":"n-20261006-61h4iy","category":"tech","display_title":"Ofcom Investigates Meta Over Instagram Feature","display_title_he":"רגולטור התקשורת הבריטי חוקר את מטא בעקבות פיצ'ר חדש באינסטגרם","short_summary":"UK regulator Ofcom has opened an investigation into Meta regarding safety checks for the new Instagram Instants feature. The tech giant maintains it conducted proper risk analyses before launch.","english_level":"C1","words":433,"reading_time":3,"image":null,"sources":[{"name":"BBC News","domain":"bbc.co.uk","url":"https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cq8jzyey8e2ro","title":"Ofcom investigates Meta over Instagram Instants feature","published_at":"2026-10-06T09:04:02.000Z"},{"name":"The Guardian","domain":"theguardian.com","url":"https://www.theguardian.com/technology/2026/oct/06/ofcom-investigates-meta-instagram-instants-safety-checks","title":"Ofcom investigates Meta over Instagram Instants safety checks","published_at":"2026-10-06T13:22:43.000Z"}],"published_at":"2026-10-06T09:04:02.000Z","first_published_in_app_at":"2026-10-06T15:14:57.537Z","quality_score":9,"interest_score":8,"verification_status":"verified","content_status":"published","paragraphs":["The British communications regulator, Ofcom, has initiated a formal investigation into Meta concerning the safety evaluations conducted for a prominent Instagram tool. According to the regulatory body, the $1.9tn tech giant is suspected of breaching its legal duties under the United Kingdom's robust Online Safety Act. The intense scrutiny focuses on the May rollout of Instagram Instants, a feature designed to let users capture and share spontaneous photos with close friends or mutual followers. These visual messages automatically disappear once viewed by the recipient, mimicking tools used by rival platforms like Snapchat and WhatsApp.","Official representatives stated that the social media conglomerate failed to perform a suitable and sufficient illegal content risk assessment and children's risk assessment prior to releasing the product. Under the sweeping regulations of the Online Safety Act, technology platforms are legally mandated to evaluate, update, and mitigate potential hazards before introducing significant service updates. Furthermore, these companies must clearly demonstrate how they prevent minor users from encountering harmful material, which encompasses priority primary content such as pornography, abusive behavior, and content promoting self-harm or suicide, alongside hateful or bullying material.","Ofcom enforcement director George Lusty emphasized that digital safety measures must be integrated during the design phase rather than added as an afterthought. He compared the regulation to vehicular safety, noting astutely that manufacturers would never launch a new car without proper testing beforehand. Highlighting the watchdog's stance, Lusty remarked that safety by design must be built in, not bolted on, and stressed that the ongoing investigation proves the regulator will take swift action where providers fail to comply.","In response to the probe, a spokesperson for Meta asserted that the corporation takes its obligations under the regulatory framework very seriously. The company maintained that it executed a comprehensive risk analysis and briefed Ofcom on multiple occasions prior to the public release. Additionally, Meta highlighted that Instants incorporates built-in safeguards, such as default protections for teen accounts that prevent screenshots, forwarding, or resharing of the disappearing images. The spokesperson confirmed that the firm intends to cooperate fully with Ofcom throughout the ongoing inquiry.","Meanwhile, this regulatory clash unfolds alongside separate legal battles between major technology firms and the British watchdog. Meta, alongside TikTok and Elon Musk’s platform X, has engaged in judicial review proceedings in the high court to challenge Ofcom's enforcement approaches and extensive information requests. Meta is also contesting specific financial and operational requirements, arguing against fees based on its global annual revenue and challenging the regulatory placement of its messaging and image-sharing services into categories that subject them to additional duties under the digital safety legislation."],"facts":[{"fact":"Ofcom is investigating Meta over whether it breached the Online Safety Act by failing to conduct proper risk assessments prior to launching Instagram Instants.","sources":[1,2]},{"fact":"Instagram Instants is a feature launched in May that allows users to share spontaneous images with close friends or reciprocal followers that disappear after viewing.","sources":[1,2]},{"fact":"Meta stated that it conducted a risk analysis, briefed Ofcom multiple times before the launch, included teen protections, and will cooperate with the investigation.","sources":[1,2]},{"fact":"Meta, TikTok, and X are also challenging Ofcom's enforcement of the Online Safety Act through judicial review in court.","sources":[1,2]}],"glossary":[{"text":"British","lemma":"British","pos":"adj","he":"בריטי","name":"false"},{"text":"communications","lemma":"communication","pos":"n","he":"תקשורת","name":false},{"text":"regulator","lemma":"regulator","pos":"n","he":"רגולטור, מפקח","name":false},{"text":"Ofcom","lemma":"Ofcom","pos":"n","he":"אוף-קום (רסון התקשורת הבריטי)","name":"true"},{"text":"initiated","lemma":"initiate","pos":"v","he":"היתחיל, פתח","name":false},{"text":"formal","lemma":"formal","pos":"adj","he":"רשמי","name":false},{"text":"investigation","lemma":"investigation","pos":"n","he":"חקירה","name":false},{"text":"Meta","lemma":"Meta","pos":"n","he":"מטה (חברת האם של אינסטגרם)","name":"true"},{"text":"concerning","lemma":"concerning","pos":"prep","he":"בנוגע ל-","name":false},{"text":"safety","lemma":"safety","pos":"n","he":"בטיחות","name":false},{"text":"evaluations","lemma":"evaluation","pos":"n","he":"הערכות","name":false},{"text":"conducted","lemma":"conduct","pos":"v","he":"ביצע, נהל","name":false},{"text":"prominent","lemma":"prominent","pos":"adj","he":"בולט, מובל","name":false},{"text":"Instagram","lemma":"Instagram","pos":"n","he":"אינסטגרם","name":"true"},{"text":"tool","lemma":"tool","pos":"n","he":"כלי","name":false},{"text":"regulatory","lemma":"regulatory","pos":"adj","he":"רגולטורי, מחוקק","name":false},{"text":"body","lemma":"body","pos":"n","he":"גוף","name":false},{"text":"giant","lemma":"giant","pos":"n","he":"ענק","name":false},{"text":"suspected","lemma":"suspect","pos":"v","he":"חשד","name":false},{"text":"breaching","lemma":"breach","pos":"v","he":"הפר","name":false},{"text":"legal","lemma":"legal","pos":"adj","he":"משפטי, חוקי","name":false},{"text":"duties","lemma":"duty","pos":"n","he":"חובות","name":false},{"text":"United Kingdom","lemma":"United Kingdom","pos":"n","he":"הממלכה המאוחדת","name":"true"},{"text":"robust","lemma":"robust","pos":"adj","he":"איתן, חזק","name":false},{"text":"Online Safety Act","lemma":"Online Safety Act","pos":"n","he":"חוק הבטיחות ברשת","name":"true"},{"text":"intense","lemma":"intense","pos":"adj","he":"יסודי, יקד","name":false},{"text":"scrutiny","lemma":"scrutiny","pos":"n","he":"בדיקה דקנית, בקרה","name":false},{"text":"focuses","lemma":"focus","pos":"v","he":"מתמקד","name":false},{"text":"rollout","lemma":"rollout","pos":"n","he":"השקה, פרסום","name":false},{"text":"Instants","lemma":"Instants","pos":"n","he":"אינסטנטס (תכונת תמונות)","name":"true"},{"text":"feature","lemma":"feature","pos":"n","he":"תכונה, מאפיין","name":false},{"text":"designed","lemma":"design","pos":"v","he":"עוצב, נועד","name":false},{"text":"let","lemma":"let","pos":"v","he":"איפשר","name":false},{"text":"capture","lemma":"capture","pos":"v","he":"ללופ, לצלם","name":false},{"text":"share","lemma":"share","pos":"v","he":"לשתף","name":false},{"text":"spontaneous","lemma":"spontaneous","pos":"adj","he":"ספונטני","name":false},{"text":"photos","lemma":"photo","pos":"n","he":"תמונות","name":false},{"text":"close frien